title: Trusted redirector leads to a lure
severity: medium
score: 20
tags: redirector-abuse, phishing
attack: T1566.002, T1204.001
description: The chain included a trusted redirector or open redirect (Google AMP, ad click,
  Safe Links, a URL shortener). The run also tripped a phishing, ClickFix or download
  signal.
---
// A trusted redirector sent the visitor on ...
trusted_redirector_hops
// ... to a brand page asking for a secret, a clipboard command or a risky download.
| where exists(brand_secret_page) or exists(clipboard_commands) or exists(unprompted_risky_downloads)
| distinct from_host
